'''Jotun Bane''' is the sixth one-handed [[Axes|axe]]. It can be used to chop down [[Beech]], [[Birch]], [[Oak]], [[Fir]], [[Pine]], [[Ancient Tree|Ancient]], [[Yggdrasil Shoot|Yggdrasil]], [[Scorched Tree|Scorched]] and [[Timber Tree|Timber]] trees.

* Its primary attack is a 3-hit combo with double damage on the last hit.
* The secondary attack is a slow but powerful overhead swing, ''perfect'' for removing tree stumps that are too low to hit with a normal swing.

The Jotun Bane is capable of dispelling the [[Mist]] of [[Mistlands]] in a 9-meter radius.

